WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.257
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B two, Book three.

2
00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:09.188
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:16.134
Unit seventeen: Artificial Intelligence Ethics. Today you will show cause and effect with 'as'.

4
00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:19.121
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:23.555
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:25.929
AI ethics.

7
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:30.890
AI ethics means right and wrong ways to use artificial intelligence.

8
00:00:31.483 --> 00:00:33.785
We discussed AI ethics in class.

9
00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:37.663
Your turn. Say: AI ethics.

10
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.650
AI ethics.

11
00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:44.336
Bias.

12
00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.965
Bias means unfair support for one side.

13
00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.317
AI can learn bias from data.

14
00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.047
Your turn. Say: Bias.

15
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:56.913
Bias.

16
00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:58.999
Transparency.

17
00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:03.423
Transparency means being open about how something works.

18
00:01:04.017 --> 00:01:06.701
We need transparency about AI decisions.

19
00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:10.166
Your turn. Say: Transparency.

20
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.349
Transparency.

21
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:16.479
Accountability.

22
00:01:17.483 --> 00:01:20.539
Accountability means being responsible for results.

23
00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.730
Who has accountability when AI makes a mistake?

24
00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:27.387
Your turn. Say: Accountability.

25
00:01:30.233 --> 00:01:31.443
Accountability.

26
00:01:32.183 --> 00:01:33.219
Automation.

27
00:01:34.217 --> 00:01:37.284
Automation means machines doing work instead of people.

28
00:01:37.883 --> 00:01:40.138
Automation is changing factories.

29
00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:43.484
Your turn. Say: Automation.

30
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:47.369
Automation.

31
00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:49.141
Privacy.

32
00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.136
Privacy means keeping personal information safe.

33
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.446
Smart speakers raise privacy questions.

34
00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.737
Your turn. Say: Privacy.

35
00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.648
Privacy.

36
00:02:04.383 --> 00:02:05.559
Regulation.

37
00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.770
Regulation means official rules.

38
00:02:09.383 --> 00:02:11.476
AI needs clear regulation.

39
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:14.933
Your turn. Say: Regulation.

40
00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.023
Regulation.

41
00:02:19.783 --> 00:02:20.599
Trust.

42
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:23.908
Trust means believing something is reliable.

43
00:02:24.517 --> 00:02:26.505
Trust in AI must be earned.

44
00:02:27.117 --> 00:02:29.781
Your turn. Say: Trust.

45
00:02:32.633 --> 00:02:33.379
Trust.

46
00:02:34.167 --> 00:02:37.469
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:38.317 --> 00:02:40.897
Visal, why do people worry about AI?

48
00:02:41.983 --> 00:02:45.597
As automation grows, ethical concerns increase.

49
00:02:46.683 --> 00:02:48.253
What kind of concerns?

50
00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:53.985
As AI collects more data, privacy becomes harder to protect.

51
00:02:55.083 --> 00:02:56.526
What is the solution?

52
00:02:57.617 --> 00:03:01.302
Regulation. As rules improve, trust will grow.

53
00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:04.130
Part three: grammar.

54
00:03:04.983 --> 00:03:08.039
Grammar focus: As plus clause (cause and effect).

55
00:03:08.339 --> 00:03:09.480
Look at the pattern.

56
00:03:10.183 --> 00:03:13.367
As automation grows, ethical concerns increase.

57
00:03:14.283 --> 00:03:18.129
As AI collects more data, privacy becomes harder to protect.

58
00:03:19.017 --> 00:03:21.585
As rules improve, trust will grow.

59
00:03:22.533 --> 00:03:27.891
'As' can show that one change causes another. Use a comma after the 'as' clause when it comes first.

60
00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:32.881
Be careful! Don't say: As automation grow, concerns increase.

61
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:38.249
Say: As automation grows, concerns increase.

62
00:03:38.549 --> 00:03:40.653
Singular subject: grows.

63
00:03:41.467 --> 00:03:44.061
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:44.867 --> 00:03:46.495
Thinking About AI.

65
00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:49.131
AI is now part of daily life.

66
00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:53.514
As automation grows, ethical concerns increase.

67
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.533
AI can show bias if its data is unfair.

68
00:03:58.533 --> 00:04:02.472
As AI collects more data, privacy becomes a big issue.

69
00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:07.301
Transparency, accountability and regulation build trust.

70
00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:12.251
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

71
00:04:13.117 --> 00:04:15.766
As automation blank, concerns increase.

72
00:04:16.066 --> 00:04:19.453
A, grows. B, grow. C, growing.

73
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.034
The answer is A: grows.

74
00:04:26.183 --> 00:04:27.777
Official rules are blank.

75
00:04:28.077 --> 00:04:32.101
A, regulation. B, automation. C, bias.

76
00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:37.968
The answer is A: regulation.

77
00:04:39.117 --> 00:04:41.708
Being open about how something works is blank.

78
00:04:42.008 --> 00:04:46.219
A, transparency. B, privacy. C, trust.

79
00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:52.463
The answer is A: transparency.

80
00:04:53.667 --> 00:04:57.027
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

81
00:04:57.883 --> 00:05:00.463
What ethical concern about AI worries you most?

82
00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.785
Now listen to Visal.

83
00:05:11.085 --> 00:05:19.066
Bias worries me most. As AI makes more decisions about jobs and loans, unfair data could hurt many people.

84
00:05:19.366 --> 00:05:21.203
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:05:22.117 --> 00:05:26.801
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and as plus clause (cause and effect).

86
00:05:27.101 --> 00:05:31.854
Today's value is ethical awareness. Think about what is right before you act.

87
00:05:32.154 --> 00:05:34.818
See you in Unit eighteen. Goodbye!

88
00:05:35.118 --> 00:05:38.920
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

